      "description": "Describe a scene and get video with synchronised audio. This is OliviaRossi's PRISM DMAD PDMD in its full-size int8 file: her merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max, with the DMAD and PDMD distillations built in. There is no LoRA to load and nothing extra to install.\n\nThe picture is textured and lively: gritty skin, big expressions and plenty of motion, and it follows a camera move such as a push-in or a dolly closely. The PRISM DMAD PDMD pack has the same cards on the author's smaller file, which gave the same pictures in our test and runs about 10% faster.\n\nEight steps by default: about 75 s per five-second shot at 480p on a 12 GB card with Faster Attention on. The slider goes from four to ten.\n\nDownloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed.\n\nModel format: int8 ConvRot.",
